 >>[2026-04-01 00:00] observe — created this wip as a file-as-prompt surface so editor-contract thinking can happen inside the repo instead of staying ephemeral in chat.
 >>[2026-04-01 00:00] observe — the current architecture already has a strong semantic server center, but the request layer, invalidation rules, and surface vocabulary still feel provisional and spread across multiple client surfaces.
 >>[2026-04-01 00:00] decide — use this branch to formalize observation ownership before adding more UX-specific behavior or syntax pressure.
